    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a pixel-packed, mind-bending journey with <i><strong>Blu-Dude in the Quest of Reality in Time</strong></i>, where the boundaries of reality dissolve into lines of code, and nothing is quite as it seems. Meet Blu-Dude\u2014a cheerful and energetic sprite on a straightforward mission, or so he thought. As he ventures forward, Blu-Dude realizes there\u2019s an unsettling force beneath the surface. Is he just a character in a game, or does his world hold a complexity far beyond what he understands?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You the gamer must embark on a journey with Blu-Dude, navigate through a vibrant, retro-styled world. Filled with secrets and NPC's who might not be what they seem. Blu-Dudes mission? To understand his purpose and maybe even meet his creators.\u00a0 Along the way, you'll help him uncover the truth to his 8-bit world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Blu-Dude In The Quest of Reality In Time</i></strong> features many vibrant areas for you to explore with Blu-Dude. Enjoy a semi-open world adventure where you decide the pace!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Blu-Dude progresses, players will uncover in the following gameplay below.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique art styles</strong>: Each artist on our team meshed styles to help create Blu-Dude In The Quest of Reality In Time. Many fun filled hours have been spent creating this world.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fourth-Wall Breaks</strong>: Experience moments where Blu-Dude and Developers directly talk to each other adding to the reality of the situation.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> We want this to be enjoyable for you play at your own pace! Take your time or speed run to see what Reality Blu-Dude really is!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music:</strong> Featuring music from both Oregon local artists and custom made tracks for your listening enjoyment.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-D</strong> Side Scroller with a linear open world mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Blu-Dude in the Quest of Reality in Time</i>, you\u2019re not merely playing a game\u2014you\u2019re part of Blu-Dude\u2019s search for truth, a quest that spirals into questions of existence and purpose that may even have you questioning your own. Are you guiding Blu-Dude, or is he reaching out to understand <i>you</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302950/extras/f3650c6b1b9d182d35f03e0f75aed973.avif?t=1753893937\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p>",
