e or speed run to see what Reality Blu-Dude really is!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music:</strong> Featuring music from both Oregon local artists and custom made tracks for your listening enjoyment.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-D</strong> Side Scroller with a linear open world mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Blu-Dude in the Quest of Reality in Time</i>, you\u2019re not merely playing a game\u2014you\u2019re part of Blu-Dude\u2019s search for truth, a quest that spirals into questions of existence and purpose that may even have you questioning your own. Are you guiding Blu-Dude, or is he reaching out to understand <i>you</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302950/extras/f3650c6b1b9d182d35f03e0f75aed973.avif?t=1753893937\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p>",
